{"manifest":"{\"format\":1,\"version\":\"5.0.6\",\"notes\":\"5.0.6 — Kovan beta 0.1.2: League Asistanı genişledi (canlı maç + takım analizi, şampiyon seçimi paneli, hat tahmini, LP hedefi, gerçek derece amblemleri, temalı liste/otomatik tamamlama, isteğe bağlı counterpick.lol verisi, eşleşmeye özel rün önerisi ve 'Kovan' rün sayfasını League'e yazma — her yazmada onay). Güncel yetenek metinleri (eski ipuçları kalktı). 'Dürüst sınırlar' bilgi kutuları kaldırıldı. Windows'ta ve gerçek League istemcisiyle denenmedi.\",\"minLoader\":1,\"created\":\"2026-11-04T20:26:25.169Z\",\"files\":{\"StatScan.html\":{\"sha256\":\"f7b26eb536eb6fa4b637cd70e9d32d87fa014130bd27f87698c63c95923079d5\",\"size\":1397656},\"desktop/app.js\":{\"sha256\":\"53dbdbb7ea410ef4efc8bdd6f6ba3f5343ef85708771128b48afb74756468c51\",\"size\":12999},\"desktop/assets/icon.ico\":{\"sha256\":\"b0d623d0b828bcf7603ee02ac7b5cc8e9b27b13fdb5c3eff548f2cb7b7963543\",\"size\":372526},\"desktop/assets/icon.png\":{\"sha256\":\"6ce7c330fdcf2d8785ba7ea16895cc376bfbb22b4ee061da7a0692002c3ca376\",\"size\":99730},\"desktop/host.js\":{\"sha256\":\"57c5eb60b6b9838cbadf35f9496617a2e7feeb665b5a0c74000a93b11c6f6ff3\",\"size\":305097},\"desktop/preload.js\":{\"sha256\":\"8d4a80475b8c80663d247722a236a3531064d67cab7b366ff6526a858292ef6a\",\"size\":8060},\"dyn/collector.ps1\":{\"sha256\":\"3329b8cdf5257002b1f0fbe10bbc0da8ed09103d33ff67618ab8d897a61b71cb\",\"size\":39356},\"dyn/README-dinamik.md\":{\"sha256\":\"da91e62f58ce365cdec59c1ec4b689c8cf0412e742c1ea728d8ba09394485b0d\",\"size\":7201},\"dyn/statscan-dyn.js\":{\"sha256\":\"bfc3f746e061f22ae93f36968e0952f2162470b39534a2d3f8c6489795b0f883\",\"size\":115235}}}","sig":"sXZCAG7dzWVH94D7aMEaK/qkKphF2e38iz2dA5AtUqA/p/WioZso3rtpB8rJhHlK7WY+jdEB508FvcV89Q4fDQ==","data":{"StatScan.html":"","desktop/app.js":"","desktop/assets/icon.ico":"","desktop/assets/icon.png":"","desktop/host.js":"","desktop/preload.js":"","dyn/collector.ps1":"","dyn/README-dinamik.md":"","dyn/statscan-dyn.js":""}}